Section: 1 Introduction
Text: In summary, the contributions of this paper are as follows: • We explore a selected sharing layer relying on gate mechanism and attention mechanism, which can selectively capture valuable shared features between tasks of fake news detection and stance detection for respective tasks. • The transformer encoder is introduced into our model for encoding inputs of both tasks, which enhances the performance of our method by taking advantages of its long-range dependencies and parallelism.

